  fullText: Do not tell anyone this, but apparently the surface team that recently\nwent
    to investigate the supposed meteorite has made an incredible\ndiscovery.\nTheir
    commander has already approved a second expedition to bring\ndown whatever they
    found.\nThere is a lot of secrecy around it, but I will share more with you as\nsoon
    as I know more.\n- Prremp
